---
title: Scoped capability requests
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client
    participant fclt
    participant Cache as Machine cache
    participant Roots as Recorded dependencies
    Client->>fclt: Scoped inventory or query
    fclt->>Cache: Read snapshot and dependencies
    fclt->>Roots: Check dependency metadata
    alt Valid cache
        fclt-->>Client: Existing JSON shape
    else Missing or changed
        fclt-->>Client: snapshot-stale or snapshot-unavailable
    end
